sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Simulated client
  participant V as D2C venue (QuickFIX/J acceptor)
  participant D as Simulated dealers A to E
  participant G as Engine FixSession and VenueGateway
  participant E as Engine (SBE messages)

  C->>V: RFQ: instrument, side, size, 3 to 5 dealers
  V->>G: QuoteRequest R (131, 146 group, 453 client, 9501)
  G->>E: SBE QuoteRequest (10)
  V->>D: request
  D-->>V: quotes after lognormal delays
  E->>G: SBE Quote (11)
  G->>V: Quote S (131, 117, 132 to 135)
  V-->>G: QuoteStatusReport AI 297=0
  Note over V: window closes or every dealer answered
  V->>C: every quote
  C->>V: trade with the best, pass, or trade elsewhere
  alt we won
    V->>G: QuoteResponse AJ 694=1, 44, 9502 cover
    V->>G: ExecutionReport 8 150=F
    G->>E: SBE QuoteResponse Done, SBE ExecutionReport
  else another dealer won
    V->>G: QuoteResponse AJ 694=5 9503=TA
  else client traded elsewhere
    V->>G: QuoteResponse AJ 694=5 9503=DA
  else client passed
    V->>G: QuoteResponse AJ 694=6
  end
  Note over V,G: if our session drops before the decision, our quote is removed (cancel-on-disconnect)
